    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="818355e0-d655-5487-b4ca-c4e6913cb84d" activityNameId="7a704a96-d5ea-5952-8f1c-a03454ad1438" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Magnesium, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Magnesium, at plant
Large uncertainties exist for data on energy use and SF6 emissions during magnesium production. This inventory describes an assumption for the average production.;
CAS number: 007439-95-4; 
Formula: Mg; 
UUID: a8da43dc-78aa-3945-a75e-474b4e87c7fb
Resource extraction until gate of the factory including infrastructure.
Location: Data from literature and for 1 producer
Technology: Production of magnesium from seawater and dolomite in a modern production plant based on data from a Norwegian producer.
Time period: Environmental report
Production volume: 372000 tonnes in 1998
Sampling: Environmental data for an important producer 
Extrapolations: From 1 producer to average Europe, energy uses disaggregated from cumulated figures. Type of electricity mix not known.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a8da43dc-78aa-3945-a75e-474b4e87c7fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
